rooms_desc ({"Here you are in a big and well lighted room with two windows in each side. On the center is a long table with a lot of books on it.Some of them seem to be in a poor condition. On the side of the table is a chair with lots of buttons on it's arm. On the west wall isa portrait of an old looking man. The shelves are full of dust. You canhere no one noise from the street. Maybe there is somebody onthe northern room.","A well furnished and working room where nobody can find the right placeof the things. It is full of different plants hanging from every direction.","Huh. So many things in here. Maybe if you look around you will findany usefull stuff. Or at another way ask the owner of the house.He canfind something for sure.","There is a cocteil desk on the corner and a cubboard full of beers,wines,whisky and alcohol drinks in it.","You can hardly see in the darkness.There is a door on the west.You think it would be better to leave from here.","A very kind smell make you feel hungry.There are three cookers who move continualy from one side to the otherand who looks very busy with cooking.","A very quite room, with a big bed, a table and an armchair on it.Looks like a very comfortable room at all.","A short corridor leading to the sleeping room.",0,0,})
